@startuml CU-02
actor "Administrador" as Admin
boundary "«UI» Angular (admin)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /users" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» UserService / role, employee, branch" as Model

Admin -> UI : 1: solicitud
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /users/roles
Ctrl -> Model : 3: list_roles(db)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: roles
Ctrl --> UI : 5: RoleRead[]
UI --> Admin : 6: roles visibles

Admin -> UI : 7: nuevo empleado
UI -> Ctrl : 8: POST /users
Ctrl -> Model : 9: create(db, payload)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: UserRead
Ctrl --> UI : 11: 201
UI --> Admin : 12: empleado creado

Admin -> UI : 13: vincular a sucursal
UI -> Ctrl : 14: POST /users/{id}/employee
Ctrl -> Model : 15: link_employee(db, …)
Model --> Ctrl : 16: EmployeeRead
Ctrl --> UI : 17: 201 con branch
UI --> Admin : 18: empleado asignado

@enduml